1084770/extras/9c2cc293323fb35eef0c933298be1aa5.mp4?t=1724983524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Note: I am a solo indie game developer and I have done graphics, animation, programming, character designing, level design etc except for the music. I hope you will enjoy the game.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1084770/extras/da5aae04f138c530ee7275ab5c8cea95.poster.avif?t=1724983524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1084770/extras/da5aae04f138c530ee7275ab5c8cea95.webm?t=1724983524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1084770/extras/da5aae04f138c530ee7275ab5c8cea95.mp4?t=1724983524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
